# Run r1102, SQ-CDJ5 Boot 1, long part: SQ-FGD-07 (pigs dig truffle dirt and podzol), about 12 min.
# Same boot as b1_main.qb (run it after that file, before stopping). Needs spawn-animals=true (README Boot 1), else
# vanilla discards the pigs on their next tick. Pen: x offsets -60..-41, z 0..19 from the cdj5home marker, on the
# superflat floor (H2-1); the perfBot bots of b1_main stand within 128 blocks, so the chunks tick.
pace 2

## SQ-FGD-07a | mobGriefing true: pigs turn podzol and truffle dirt into coarse dirt
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=cdj5home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> fill {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2-1} {H3+19} minecraft:podzol
> fill {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2-1} {H3+9} fungidelight:truffle_dirt
> fill {H1-61} {H2} {H3-1} {H1-40} {H2} {H3-1} minecraft:oak_fence
> fill {H1-61} {H2} {H3+20} {H1-40} {H2} {H3+20} minecraft:oak_fence
> fill {H1-61} {H2} {H3-1} {H1-61} {H2} {H3+20} minecraft:oak_fence
> fill {H1-40} {H2} {H3-1} {H1-40} {H2} {H3+20} minecraft:oak_fence
> gamerule mobGriefing true
pace 0.2
repeat 40
> summon minecraft:pig {H1-50} {H2} {H3+10} {Age:0,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["fgdpig"]}
end
pace 2
sleep 5
> execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:pig,tag=fgdpig] run say FGD07 pigs alive
expect FGD07 pigs alive
sleep 300
> zcount {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2} {H3+19}
waitlog \[zcount\] entities 30
expect \[zcount\] blocks .*minecraft:coarse_dirt=\d+
reject (?i)Parameters not allowed|loot.*(error|exception)
look coarse dirt count (2026-10-26: 19 of 400 in about 4.5 min), truffles / sticks / clay among the entities

## SQ-FGD-07b | mobGriefing false: no block changes
# gamerule first, then let digs already running end (60 ticks; stop() checks mobGriefing), then refill: r1102 had the
# gamerule 4 s after the refill and one dig finished in that window (1 coarse dirt)
> gamerule mobGriefing false
sleep 6
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> fill {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2-1} {H3+19} minecraft:podzol
> fill {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2-1} {H3+9} fungidelight:truffle_dirt
> execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:pig,tag=fgdpig] run say FGD07 pigs alive
expect FGD07 pigs alive
sleep 240
> zcount {H1-60} {H2-1} {H3} {H1-41} {H2} {H3+19}
waitlog \[zcount\] entities 30
reject \[zcount\] blocks .*minecraft:coarse_dirt=
> gamerule mobGriefing true
> kill @e[type=minecraft:pig,tag=fgdpig]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
